<view class="page"><view class="title">连接你的示例门店</view><view class="subtitle">电脑与手机共用同一套商品和导购服务。</view><view class="panel"><view class="panel-head">门店服务器</view><view class="panel-body"><view class="field"><label class="label" for="server-address">服务器地址</label><input id="server-address" value="{{base}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="http://电脑局域网IP:3001" placeholder-class="placeholder" maxlength="180"/></view><view class="note address-note">开发者工具模拟器可用 http://127.0.0.1:3001。手机访问时请改为电脑当前的局域网 IP，并连接同一网络。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="connect" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存并连接</button></view><view class="status">{{connected ? '门店已连接' : '门店未连接'}} · {{ai ? '大模型已配置' : '规则导购模式'}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view></view><view class="panel"><view class="panel-head">课程演示</view><view class="panel-body"><view class="note">顾客端支持对话、图片找货、菜谱预算、购物清单和虚拟门店导航。超市端支持录入、图片分区、按需查询新发地与人工定价。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="guide">返回导购</button><button bindtap="store">进入超市端</button></view><button class="text-button clear-button" bindtap="clear">清空本机购物清单</button></view></view><view class="footer-note">语音可使用手机键盘的语音输入。<view>图片将发往你配置的门店及模型服务。</view><view>正式发布需配置可访问的门店服务器；当前为课程演示。</view></view></view>
